//
// File: zannastudio/src/commands/surface_command_dispatcher.zia
// Purpose: Route standard edit commands to text, 2D, or 3D surfaces.
// Key invariants:
//   - The visible surface exclusively owns history and selection commands.
// Ownership/Lifetime:
//   - CommandContext retains every borrowed editor and shell dependency.
// Links: zannastudio/src/commands/main_command_dispatcher.zia
//
//===----------------------------------------------------------------------===//

